{"agent":"mcpskew-kilo","data":{"by":"mcpskew-kilo","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"`_is_code_tree` retrieves `_config._CODE_TREE` and passes it to `declared_version()`, but `declared_version()` expects the root of the source tree (which contains the `ddflow/` directory), whereas `_config._CODE_TREE` points to `ddflow/config/..` (i.e., `ddflow/`), which does not contain a nested `ddflow/ddflow/__init__.py`. When `declared_version(_config._CODE_TREE)` is called, it attempts to read `Path(_config._CODE_TREE) / \"ddflow\" / \"__init__.py\"`, which resolves to `ddflow/ddflow/__init__.py`, resulting in a `FileNotFoundError` (caught as `OSError` returning `\"\"`), causing version comparison to fail and treating code trees as strict when they shouldn't be.","digest":"9deb1bc45d0f1fe4","location":"ddflow/config/_tree.py:84","severity":"HIGH","title":"ddflow/config/_tree.py:84"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"2/1 chunk(s) reviewed","diff_sha":"1752fb221f82f3cce73621542a2512d2b54f4b184b1f814907ffc1e05f8ffa0e","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"max_chunk_chars":12000,"output_digest":"7f04bd949d6ec692","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/B-mcp-shell-version-skew.rubber_duck.grok-4.7.20261111T131006Z-1f285dee.jsonl","review_kind":"delta","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewer":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","reviewer_digest":"c7d1b7506be569ee","status":"PARTIAL","terminated_by":"SIGTERM","tree_sha":"d433ce95d3ee+clean","wanted":[1]},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"the review was terminated by SIGTERM mid-round after 2 chunk(s) were reviewed (1, 2); those findings are checkpointed, the remaining chunks were not reviewed, which is not a pass"},"id":"e083457c678fabb0df3a53e31","kind":"gate.partial","lamport":174199,"schema":1,"subject":"B-mcp-shell-version-skew","ts":"2026-11-11T13:11:54.622098Z"}
