{"agent":"mcpskew-kilo","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"`declared_version` only turns `OSError` into `\"\"`. `Path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")` raises `UnicodeDecodeError` (a `ValueError`) for a code tree whose `ddflow/__init__.py` is not valid UTF-8, or if the file uses a non-UTF-8 coding cookie. That exception is not caught in `_is_code_tree`, so a same-path check that used to return a bool now aborts config loading. The same exception escapes into `installed_version`: the `or info.version` fallback never runs, the bare `except Exception` returns `\"\"`, and a source-tree/editable install whose metadata version was already known (for example `0.2.11`) is reported as having no installed version.","digest":"71f3e885fba89c3c","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/config/_tree.py:declared_version","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/config/_tree.py:declared_version"}],"chunks_total":2,"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":8839,"diff_sha":"1752fb221f82f3cce73621542a2512d2b54f4b184b1f814907ffc1e05f8ffa0e","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/B-mcp-shell-version-skew","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":145.8,"family":"xai","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"0260b8829c94993b","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/B-mcp-shell-version-skew.critic.grok-4.7.20261111T131636Z-e91b65ad.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed_head":"d433ce95d3ee521590000338ed690f526e33b981","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/config/_tree.py":"100644 a0a51103020d8523ee52e1844662c0a0d30ffe27","ddflow/services/upgrade_notice.py":"100644 2c8c4b048dc7e54b50412492e3f5a04e9cc0317e","tests/test_mcp_shell_version_skew.py":"100644 10ce69d193457d3ccc37e96cffb91a651e9fc05c"},"reviewer":"grok-4.7","reviewer_digest":"1857ec352c55ee94","reviewer_families"